  "hypothesis": "JS may retain registered regions, stairways or exclusions because clear_level_structures omits explicit C cleanup calls.",
  "expectedBehavior": "Reset leaves no active region entries, zero region capacity, and null stairway/exclusion heads; repeated reset remains empty.",
  "observedBehavior": "Twenty-one populated cases (seven nonempty combinations of region/stair/exclusion registrations \u00d7 counts1,2,5) and three empty controls compare two resets each. Actual public JS level_init/gas_cloud/ladder/exclusion/reset_level APIs match exact compiled C reset/clear and region/stair/exclusion free functions on zero region count/capacity, no active region array entries and null stair/exclusion heads. Both resets match in all48 stages.",
